  "description": "The SCOTT Addict 25 is a road bike designed for cyclists who want to enjoy the open road—whether it’s a weekend spin or a longer journey. It offers a balanced, accessible way to ride further, with comfort and confidence without compromising on quality or breaking the bank.\n\nWith an ride-focused geometry, the bike prioritizes comfort for long distances, so you can ride at your own pace without the strain of an aggressive race fit. The lightweight HMF carbon frame provides a responsive feel, while rough roads are smoothed out by high-volume Schwalbe ONE 34mm tires. Your tools and essentials are in easy reach with the internal frame storage, so you’re always prepared for the ride ahead.\n\nBuilt around a SRAM Rival AXS drivetrain and a 2x crankset with an integrated power meter, the bike delivers reliable shifting and lets you monitor your progress—all in a package that’s thoughtfully priced.\n\nFor riders who value endurance, versatility, and a connected riding experience, the Addict 25 is a steady companion for every mile.\n\nPlease note that bike specifications are subject to change without prior notice.",
